## wd2l audit rules for the Quadlet unit, Enclave 1 log server (docs/deployment/containers.md).
## Only where Podman is installed: auditd refuses a watch whose directory is missing
## (/etc/containers/systemd), and augenrules stops loading rules there.
## Copy to /etc/audit/rules.d/wd2l-quadlet.rules, then: sudo augenrules --load
-a always,exit -F arch=b64 -F path=/etc/containers/systemd/wd2l-sender.container -F perm=wa -k wd2l-units
-a always,exit -F arch=b32 -F path=/etc/containers/systemd/wd2l-sender.container -F perm=wa -k wd2l-units
